      en: ["'Heenat' means 'hay' and 'Salma' is a traditional female name.", "The farm was founded in 2017.", "Offers a 'farm-to-table' restaurant concept.", "All buildings are constructed from natural and recycled materials.", "Houses a library focusing on ecology and philosophy.", "Runs an artist-in-residence program.", "The restaurant's menu changes daily based on the harvest."],
